        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "sure, here's the config I got through the command:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  mappings = {\r\n    ['\"'] = {\r\n      action = \"closeopen\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = '\"\"',\r\n      register = {\r\n        cr = false\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    [\"'\"] = {\r\n      action = \"closeopen\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^%a\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"''\",\r\n      register = {\r\n        cr = false\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    [\"(\"] = {\r\n      action = \"open\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"()\"\r\n    },\r\n    [\")\"] = {\r\n      action = \"close\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"()\"\r\n    },\r\n    [\"[\"] = {\r\n      action = \"open\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"[]\"\r\n    },\r\n    [\"]\"] = {\r\n      action = \"close\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"[]\"\r\n    },\r\n    [\"`\"] = {\r\n      action = \"closeopen\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"``\",\r\n      register = {\r\n        cr = false\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    [\"{\"] = {\r\n      action = \"open\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"{}\"\r\n    },\r\n    [\"}\"] = {\r\n      action = \"close\",\r\n      neigh_pattern = \"[^\\\\].\",\r\n      pair = \"{}\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  modes = {\r\n    command = false,\r\n    insert = true,\r\n    terminal = false\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nalso, this is the setup i have in my config\r\n<img width=\"474\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/128014942/f0a7e5fd-9d49-40c0-b039-8c8572f1a1b6\">\r\n",
